  <div class="sec" id="faq">
    <div class="wrap faq">
      <div class="faq-heading">
        <h2><svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9.8 9a2.3 2.3 0 1 1 3.9 1.7c-1.1 1-1.7 1.4-1.7 2.8M12 17h.01"/></svg><span>Questions before you start.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="panel faq-card">
        <details open><summary data-umami-event="faq_toggle" data-umami-event-q="What is Druks">What is Druks?</summary><p>Druks is a self-hosted or cloud platform where AI agents such as Claude Code and Codex do a company's recurring engineering work, and a person approves each change.</p></details>
        <details><summary data-umami-event="faq_toggle" data-umami-event-q="Which AI account does it use">Which AI account does it use?</summary><p>Your own Claude or OpenAI account. Druks runs the official Claude Code or Codex tools with it. You see the cost after every step.</p></details>
        <details><summary data-umami-event="faq_toggle" data-umami-event-q="Can it change my code without asking">Can it change my code without asking?</summary><p>No. A run stops before anything changes in your repositories and waits for your decision, up to 14 days. It costs nothing while it waits.</p></details>
        <details><summary data-umami-event="faq_toggle" data-umami-event-q="Is Druks open source">Is Druks open source?</summary><p>Druks is source available under the Functional Source License (FSL). You can self-host it, change it and build apps on it. Each release becomes Apache 2.0 two years after it ships.</p></details>
        <details><summary data-umami-event="faq_toggle" data-umami-event-q="How is Druks different from n8n, Multica or Copilot">How is Druks different from n8n, Multica or Copilot?</summary><p>Druks comes with processes that already run, like the security sweep. The work starts by itself from a schedule or an alert, uses your own AI tools, and reaches you as one decision.</p></details>
      </div>
      <a class="section-next" href="#closing" aria-label="Try it now">Try it now<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 13V3m-4 4 4-4 4 4"/></svg></a>
